  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.10: Inline-level source ranges are now absolute document coordinates (#38). Since 1.0.9, `InlineLayout.Source` (and the Avalonia `SourceRangeProperty` that mirrors it) carried block-RELATIVE positions, so every rendered inline reported line 1 and an editor's inline click-to-source resolved every click to the document's first line. `LayoutBuilder` now promotes each inline's range to absolute coordinates using the owning block's content origin; lines are absolute for every block kind, and columns are exact for paragraphs and headings. `InlineParser`'s deliberately slice-relative ranges are unchanged. See CHANGELOG.md.",
